# PremiumSaaS Project Blueprint

## 1. Project Overview
A high-performance, enterprise-grade landing page built for "PremiumSaaS". The architecture focuses on speed (Vite), type safety (TypeScript), and scalable styling (Tailwind CSS + Shadcn/UI).

## 2. Tech Stack
- **Frontend Framework:** React 18+ (via Vite)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (Utility-first, JIT engine)
- **UI Components:** Shadcn/UI (Radix UI primitives)
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Animations:** Framer Motion
- **Type Safety:** TypeScript (Strict Mode)
- **Deployment:** Vercel / Docker-ready

## 3. Architecture & Folder Structure (Atomic Design)
\`\`\`text
PremiumSaaS/
├── src/
│   ├── assets/             # Static assets (images, svgs)
│   ├── components/         # Atomic components
│   │   ├── ui/             # Shadcn primitives (Button, Input, etc.)
│   │   ├── shared/         # Reusable layouts (Navbar, Footer)
│   │   └── sections/       # Page-specific sections (Hero, Features, Pricing)
│   ├── hooks/              # Custom React hooks
│   ├── lib/                # Utilities (cn, providers, formatters)
│   ├── styles/             # Global CSS and Tailwind configs
│   └── App.tsx             # Root component
├── public/                 # Favicons, robots.txt
├── tailwind.config.ts      # Custom theme & design tokens
└── tsconfig.json           # Strict TS configuration
\`\`\`

## 4. Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Foundation
- Initialize Vite + TS template.
- Configure Tailwind CSS with "Midnight Slate" design tokens (custom colors, glassmorphism).
- Install core dependencies: \`lucide-react\`, \`framer-motion\`, \`clsx\`, \`tailwind-merge\`.

### Phase 2: Design System (Atomic UI)
- Build the core palette and typography scales.
